  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nSUBMIT YOUR RESEARCH ENQUIRY\n\nUse the online form below to submit your enquiry, or download a copy of the form and email or post it to us using the details below.\n\nPlease make sure you have read the details on our main Research Page before submitting your enquiry, or contact us for more information if unsure.\n\nIf there is more information potentially available and therefore more time is needed, you will be advised in advance. In some cases this may result in a quotation for additional work.\n\nTo start your research enquiry please choose which type of search you would like, then complete at least 2 parts in section 1.\n\nYou can view an example of a completed Enquiry Report here.\n\n---\n\nDownload and fill out a copy of our Research Service Form: (Download PDF) (Download Word Document)\n\nEmail a copy of your completed form to us at frontofhouse@sofo.org.uk. You can still pay for Research Enquiry fees online using the listing on our website store.\n\nAlternatively, completed forms can be posted to us at: Research Service, SOFO Office, Harrisons Lane, Woodstock, OX20 1SN along with a cheque for the enquiry fee made out to 'Soldiers of Oxfordshire Museum'.\n\n---\n\nBasic Service £50\nBespoke Service £100\n\nSection 1.\n\n  \n\nSection 2. (Nature of enquiry)\n\nPlease choose the nature of your enquiry. (You may select multiple options)\n\n Operational service\n Where is my soldier buried/commemorated?\n In what action was my soldier killed/wounded?\n Where was my soldier a prisoner of war?\n Service and gallantry awards\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
